# (sound ids: tabc05wave = 4, tabc35wave = 33 in this DAT, as logged in sounds.jsonl)
# The spell targets a_spot4-7 each score 2,500 (SpellTargetControl1-4 ->
# SpellTargetBank -> ScorePart(caller, 0)); info_text_box mode is 2 (poked at f190, see the note below), the bank is not complete after four.
# The fifth target (a_spot22) completes the bank and awards a spell instead (script d_spells_award.uh).
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch v_lite3.light_on v_lite4.light_on v_lite5.light_on v_lite6.light_on v_lite7.light_on
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
# The game starts in mode 10 (PlungerControl, dragon_ball.cpp:136), where the first a_spot4 collision goes to
# Mode10LaunchBallController and awards a spell (+120,000, spells 0 -> 1, sound AwardSpell, mode 10 -> 2) before
# SpellTargetControl1 scores 2,500. The script pokes info_text_box message_field 2 (mode 2) at 190 so the
# spell-target bank itself is tested.
190 poke info_text_box message_field 2
200 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
200 expect n_score == 2500 delta 199
200 expect sound 4
210 event a_spot5 ControlCollision
210 expect n_score == 2500 delta 209
220 event a_spot6 ControlCollision
220 expect n_score == 2500 delta 219
230 event a_spot7 ControlCollision
230 expect n_score == 2500 delta 229
230 expect spells == 0
250 expect v_lite3.light_on == 1
250 expect v_lite6.light_on == 1
250 expect v_lite7.light_on == 0
300 quit
